OL,3,ACan Anthropic's record breaking IPO
OL,4,Astop the AI bubble bursting?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCan Anthropic's record breaking IPO
OL,7,Fstop the AI bubble bursting?
OL,9,FIt was during November 2020 that
OL,10,Fsomewhere in San Francisco, a woman
OL,11,Fcalled Daniela Amodei phoned a friend,
OL,12,Fasking for advice.
OL,14,FDaniela oversaw safety and policy at
OL,15,FOpenAI, one of the most talked-about AI
OL,16,Fcompanies in the world.
OL,18,FBut Daniela and her brother Dario - who
OL,19,Fworked there too - had misgivings over
OL,20,Fsafety levels at OpenAI and thought it
OL,21,Fcould be time to walk away.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
